        <mxCell id="nNote" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#333333;" value="N = Σ L_b = total decision steps in the batch — varies every learner step&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;(roughly 1,500–4,000): fixed number of trajectories, variable number of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;training examples. Forward-pass GPU memory scales with N.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
